meta {
  name: 15 Service Areas
  seq: 15
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Which station (branch) and sorting hub serve an address. An area is one postal code or a whole
  province; resolving tries the postal code first, then the province.

  Postal codes and the province name are generated per run (`saPostalCode`, `saOtherPostalCode`,
  `saProvince`), because a postal code can belong to only one area and the collection is re-run
  against the same database.
}
